    <div class="detail margin-top-100">
      <h3 class="panel-title bold-h3">List Your Luxury Property With VLR</h3>
      <p>If you have any questions regarding Vancouver Luxury Rentals <a href="https://www.vancouverluxuryrentals.com/property-management-vancouver">property management
          services</a>, please
        <a href="/about">contact us</a>.

      </p>
      <p>Alternatively, to submit your luxury property for listing with Vancouver Luxury Rentals, please <a href="/owners/list-properties">complete our Property Information Form</a> and the Vancouver Luxury
        Rentals team will contact you within 24 hrs.</p>

      <hr>

      <h3 class="panel-title bold-h3">What Happens Next?</h3>
      <p>At Vancouver Luxury Rentals, we understand the importance of maximizing your rental income. Once we discuss the details of your property over the phone, our dedicated team will promptly visit your property to finalize the listing process. We will work with you to determine the best rental rate for your property, utilizing our vast knowledge of the Vancouver real estate market and our experience in luxury property management. Our team will also provide expert advice on how to prepare your property for rent, ensuring you get the most return on your investment. Don't hesitate to contact us today and let Vancouver Luxury Rentals help you achieve your rental property goals.
      </p>

      <p>If you are unsure of what your property should rent for, we urge you to do your own research and <a href="/for-rent/all">review other properties</a> on our site for comparisons. </p>
